WEBVTT

00:05.120 --> 00:07.120
Planning a home?

00:07.120 --> 00:08.959
Before choosing finishes, stop and

00:08.959 --> 00:09.880
think about how you want the

00:09.880 --> 00:11.839
space to work.

00:11.839 --> 00:12.919
It's vital to start with your

00:12.919 --> 00:14.560
lifestyle, not just the look.

00:14.841 --> 00:16.241
An architect connects your needs,

00:16.241 --> 00:18.121
your site and your budget, helping

00:18.121 --> 00:19.641
you make important decisions, while

00:19.641 --> 00:20.960
they are still much easier to

00:20.960 --> 00:22.320
change during the early design

00:22.320 --> 00:22.761
phase.

00:23.082 --> 00:24.642
True design means looking beyond

00:24.642 --> 00:26.842
appearance. We consider daylight,

00:26.842 --> 00:29.402
shade, privacy, storage, and the

00:29.402 --> 00:31.002
everyday movement of people through

00:31.002 --> 00:32.562
rooms to create a home that feels

00:32.562 --> 00:33.442
naturally comfortable.

00:33.683 --> 00:35.162
The process begins with a clear

00:35.162 --> 00:37.162
brief, develops into coordinated

00:37.162 --> 00:38.722
drawings and moves towards

00:38.722 --> 00:39.923
contractor selection and

00:39.923 --> 00:41.962
construction with responsibilities

00:41.962 --> 00:43.523
agreed upon clearly at every

00:43.523 --> 00:44.763
single project stage.

00:45.044 --> 00:46.884
Architects, interior designers and

00:46.884 --> 00:49.164
contractors bring different skills.

00:49.164 --> 00:50.964
Clear coordination is the absolute

00:50.964 --> 00:52.484
secret to helping the design and

00:52.484 --> 00:54.044
the physical work on site come

00:54.044 --> 00:55.324
together seamlessly for you.

00:55.645 --> 00:57.645
Set a realistic budget, allow for

00:57.645 --> 00:59.604
uncertainty, and review changes

00:59.604 --> 01:01.285
before committing. Good design

01:01.285 --> 01:03.124
supports informed choices, helping

01:03.124 --> 01:04.525
you navigate the complexities of

01:04.525 --> 01:05.925
building a beautiful new space.

01:06.206 --> 01:08.166
At handover, check the details,

01:08.166 --> 01:10.006
record outstanding work, and take

01:10.006 --> 01:11.285
the time to understand how to

01:11.285 --> 01:13.126
care for your space. It ensures

01:13.126 --> 01:14.406
your long-term investment is

01:14.406 --> 01:15.446
properly protected.
